course: dictionary
lesson: 8286
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. Context, the words around a word, tells you which meaning is right. In «Good on ya, ripper effort», Sienna is praising a race effort, so ripper here is Aussie slang for excellent, not a tool.
explain: Ask yourself: what word would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence. If «excellent» makes sense in place of ripper, you have the right meaning.
explain: The same word can also be a thing or a person. A «seam ripper» is a sewing tool that unpicks stitches, and a ripper is a person or tool that rips or tears things. Look at the clues around the word to decide which meaning you need.
fact: A ripper is a person or tool that rips or tears things.
fact: In Australia and New Zealand, «Ripper!» is slang meaning great or excellent.
fact: «A ripper» means something really good.
fact: A «seam ripper» is a sewing tool that unpicks stitches.
fact: «Jack the Ripper» is the name given to an unknown murderer in London long ago; it is a grim part of history, so ask an adult if you want to know more.
exercise: In «Good on ya, ripper effort», what does ripper mean? | A sharp sewing tool | Slow and tired | A person who tears cloth | *Excellent, the Aussie way of saying great
exercise: What is a «seam ripper»? | *A sewing tool that unpicks stitches | A type of boat | A kind of cake | A rude word for a loser
exercise: In Australia, what does «You little ripper!» mean? | *Well done, you are great | Go away right now | You are being torn apart | You are very small and quiet
test: A child says «Yous were rubbish!» after winning. What does this tell you about the tone? | It is a kind offer to help | It is a question about tearing | *It is mean and unkind | It shows happy tears
test: Which of these is a ripper in the sense of a tool? | A small fish from the sea | *A seam ripper for unpicking stitches | A kind of Aussie wave | A bright lamp for reading
exam: Sienna swam over to the last girl after her race. What does ripper mean in «ripper effort»? | Quiet | Torn | Late | *Excellent
